sequenceDiagram
  participant M as Mobile App
  participant B as Backend FastAPI
  participant AI as Model AI

  M->>B: POST /api/v1/predict (gambar)
  B->>B: Validasi tipe dan ukuran file
  B->>AI: Inferensi gambar
  AI-->>B: Probabilitas 4 kelas penyakit
  B->>B: Lookup Knowledge Base statis
  B-->>M: JSON hasil prediksi + confidence_threshold
  M->>M: Tampilkan hasil ke pengguna
